id: pm-gantt-chart-nkvu
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.21 and move onto the canonical pm-ops merge-driver, lint and duplication gates"
description: "Pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21, pm-changelog 2026.9.18, pm-ops 2026.9.18 exactly; replace the vendored scripts/prepare-merge-driver.mjs with the thin TypeScript launcher over pm-ops/merge-driver; add canonical lint (pm-ops/eslint) and duplication (pm-ops/duplication, threshold 0, minTokens 50) gates wired into release:check and CI; fix every lint and duplication finding including the ~62 explicit any sites in test/; absorb open Dependabot PRs. Companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z (hub), release-window fix companion item pm-cli-website-3y5d; overlaps open issue pm-gantt-chart-2u8i (enriched, remaining coverage-inventory scope kept open there)."
